your line of work.</i>

25
00:01:50,667 --> 00:01:53,000
<i> Handle this one yourself.</i>

26
00:01:53,133 --> 00:01:54,967
<i>Take care of that
Salvador Manalo guy,</i>

27
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:56,667
<i> scare him, rob him.</i>

28
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,400
<i>Why are you giving this
to the newbies?</i>

29
00:01:58,533 --> 00:02:01,067
<i>It's just insulting
that this job is so easy.</i>

30
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:03,667
