very good acting!</i>

31
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:04,833
<i> She fooled me!</i>

32
00:02:04,967 --> 00:02:06,867
<i>She won't stop until
I get pinned on this case.</i>

33
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,033
<i>You broke the protocol
of your agency?!</i>

34
00:02:09,167 --> 00:02:10,533
<i> You're ruining my legacy!</i>

35
00:02:10,667 --> 00:02:13,800
The moment you tarnish my name,
I'll disown you as my daughter.

36
00:02:13,967 --> 00:02:16,200
You shouldn't have to experience
<i> a life like this.</i>

37
00:02:16,333 --> 00:02:18,933
<i>When you were a child,
our life was luxurious.</i>

38
00:02:19,067 --> 00:02:21,300
<i>When I saw the gold,
I got blinded by greed.</i>

39
00:02:21,433 --> 00:02:24,467
<i>I forgot all my promises
to Ricardo.</i>

40
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:30,267
My only thought was, "I'm going
to get rich and win your mom."

41
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:38,800
- [YOUNG GABO]<i> Yay!
</i>- [YOUNG RUDY] Daddy's coming!

42
00:02:38,933 --> 00:02:40,867
