[GABO]<i> The joy we felt
</i> whenever we're together,

46
00:02:53,533 --> 00:02:56,900
<i>the love and joy
you've given me is priceless.</i>

47
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,800
[YOUNG GABO] I love you, mommy.

48
00:03:06,233 --> 00:03:07,700
[YOUNG BELINDA] I love you!

49
00:03:12,133 --> 00:03:13,467
[YOUNG RUDY] W hy did you
do that?

50
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:14,633
