51
00:03:14,767 --> 00:03:16,867
It isn't right to punch others,
<i> Gabriel.</i>

52
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:21,067
But the kids who picked a fight
<i> with his friends are bullies.</i>

53
00:03:21,233 --> 00:03:23,300
<i>That's why Gabriel
just helped them, right?</i>

54
00:03:23,433 --> 00:03:25,167
<i>Still, you shouldn't
have punched them.</i>

55
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:26,700
<i>You can't grow up
to be a troublemaker.</i>

56
00:03:26,833 --> 00:03:28,000
<i> Do you understand?</i>

57
00:03:29,167 --> 00:03:30,600
<i> Yes...</i>

58
00:03:32,267 --> 00:03:34,233
[YOUNG BELINDA]<i> It's okay.
</i> I'll take it from here.

59
00:03:34,367 --> 00:03:37,100
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

60
00:03:37,533 --> 00:03:39,433
<i> Dear, your daddy is right.</i>

61
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:42,367
<i>If you can avoid
getting into any trouble,</i>

62
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:44,367
<i> stir away from it, okay?</i>

63
00:03:44,667 --> 00:03:47,167
<i>But I'm not saying
that you should just accept</i>

64
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:49,533
<i>the injustices you see
happening around you.</i>

65
00:03:49,667 --> 00:03:52,300
<i>If you know that you're
in the right, fight back.</i>

66
00:03:52,433 --> 00:03:55,767
<i>- Okay...
- Come here, my baby.</i>

67
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:58,800
<i>- Position!
- [YOUNG GABO GRUNTING]</i>

68
00:03:58,933 --> 00:04:00,267
<i> Down!</i>

69
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:03,767
[GRUNTING] Upper!

70
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:05,533
-[YOUNG RUDY]<i> Love, how's Gabo?
</i> - Look.

71
00:04:05,667 --> 00:04:08,133
<i>He's being taught how to do
arnis and karate.</i>

72
00:04:08,267 --> 00:04:09,700
[GABO]<i> You and mother were
</i> the ones who taught me

73
00:04:09,833 --> 00:04:12,833
<i> how to fight and defend myself</i>

74
00:04:12,967 --> 00:04:14,767
<i>as well as to help
those who are in need.</i>

75
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:16,167
<i>- Here he comes!
- [YOUNG GABO] Ha!</i>

76
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:20,533
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [BOTH GRUNTING]

77
00:04:20,667 --> 00:04:23,533
- [THUDS]
<i> - My son is the best!</i>

78
00:04:23,667 --> 00:04:25,800
<i>- You hit me!
- Come here, you!</i>

79
00:04:25,933 --> 00:04:28,033
