- [YOUNG BELINDA LAUGHS]

80
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:32,667
- [LAUGHTER]
<i> - You, guys!</i>

81
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,933
<i>You got this, son!
Don't give up!</i>

82
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,567
[YOUNG BELINDA]<i> But you have
</i> to remember.

83
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:40,367
<i> One day...</i>

84
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,467
<i> you'll be left all alone.</i>

85
00:04:43,367 --> 00:04:47,167
<i>You'll have to face
and fight all of your fears.</i>

86
00:04:50,667 --> 00:04:53,533
