93
00:05:05,733 --> 00:05:08,033
<i> Today was the day we met.</i>

94
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:10,633
[GROANS]

95
00:05:10,767 --> 00:05:12,600
<i>I didn't know we have
multiple anniversaries, love.</i>

96
00:05:12,733 --> 00:05:14,967
<i>The only one I remember
is our wedding anniversary.</i>

97
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:17,167
<i>With all of the days
I spend with you,</i>

98
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:18,333
<i> with you by my side,</i>

99
00:05:18,467 --> 00:05:20,033
<i>- Hmm?
- I treat all of those</i>

100
00:05:20,167 --> 00:05:21,333
<i> as our anniversary.</i>

101
00:05:21,467 --> 00:05:22,867
[YOUNG BELINDA LAUGHS]

102
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:25,700
<i> You don't get tired of it?</i>

103
00:05:25,933 --> 00:05:27,033
[BOTH LAUGH]

104
00:05:27,167 --> 00:05:29,767
<i>Never, even if we spend
millions of years together.</i>

105
00:05:29,900 --> 00:05:30,967
<i> Really?</i>

106
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:32,667
[YOUNG RUDY]
<i> You're the only Belinda...</i>

107
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,233
<i> I'll ever lay my eyes upon.</i>

108
00:05:35,500 --> 00:05:36,767
<i> Love...</i>

109
00:05:38,033 --> 00:05:39,800
<i> you get cornier...</i>

110
00:05:40,533 --> 00:05:42,867
<i> as the days go by!</i>

111
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,600
<i>That's because as the days
go by,</i>

112
00:05:44,733 --> 00:05:45,600
[YOUNG BELINDA]
<i> Mm-hmm?</i>

113
00:05:45,733 --> 00:05:47,967
my love for you grows even more.

114
00:05:48,733 --> 00:05:51,967
<i>I love, love, love
you so much too.</i>

115
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:57,533
<i>Thank you for the life
you've given me and Gabriel.</i>

116
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:01,467
<i> If I were to be reborn again,</i>

117
00:06:02,433 --> 00:06:06,800
<i>I'd still choose you to spend
the rest of my life with.</i>

118
00:06:06,933 --> 00:06:09,367
[RUDY] In those eight years,

119
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,933
ever since you were born, Gabo,

120
00:06:12,067 --> 00:06:14,933
<i>it was as if we were all
on cloud nine.</i>

121
00:06:15,167 --> 00:06:17,367
[GABO]<i> I remember
</i> everything, Pa.

122
00:06:17,767 --> 00:06:20,200
<i>Those were the happiest days
of our lives.</i>

123
00:06:20,333 --> 00:06:23,167
[YOUNG GABO]<i> I love you,
</i> mommy and daddy!

124
00:06:23,300 --> 00:06:24,500
[YOUNG BELINDA]
<i> We love you too, son.</i>

125
00:06:24,633 --> 00:06:27,667
[RUDY] I prayed everyday...

126
00:06:28,100 --> 00:06:31,867
<i>that those happy days
would never come to an end.</i>

127
00:06:32,567 --> 00:06:35,567
<i> But still, my sin haunts me.</i>

128
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:39,000
- [TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]
- [ENGINES REVVING]

129
00:06:39,133 --> 00:06:41,200
