141
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:22,500
<i> Where is Rudy?</i>

142
00:07:22,633 --> 00:07:25,233
<i> We are looking for Rudy.</i>

143
00:07:25,367 --> 00:07:26,467
<i> No one's here.</i>

144
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,400
<i> We know Rudy's in there.</i>

145
00:07:28,533 --> 00:07:31,700
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

146
00:07:31,833 --> 00:07:32,800
[SPITS]

147
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:34,633
<i> Rudy!</i>

148
00:07:35,667 --> 00:07:38,033
