- [BLOOD GUSHING]

157
00:08:13,367 --> 00:08:15,300
- [GATE SLAMS OPEN]
- [GUNSHOTS]

158
00:08:15,433 --> 00:08:16,633
[GATE CREAKING OPEN]

159
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:25,133
- [RAPID GUNFIRE]
- [GUNSHOTS]

160
00:08:25,133 --> 00:08:27,433
[YOUNG BELINDA]<i> Rudy, I've
</i> prepared what you asked for--

161
00:08:29,267 --> 00:08:30,300
