all this gold from?</i>

164
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:36,600
- [RAPID GUNFIRE]
- [BULLETS RICOCHETING]

165
00:08:36,733 --> 00:08:38,400
<i>Love, forgive me
for keeping this from you.</i>

166
00:08:38,533 --> 00:08:41,400
<i>I was able to become rich
because of the gold I dug.</i>

167
00:08:41,767 --> 00:08:44,267
<i>Is that why Ricardo's here?
Huh?</i>

168
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,233
<i> Is that why he's storming us?</i>

169
00:08:46,767 --> 00:08:49,200
- [GUNSHOTS]
- [MAN GROANS]

170
00:08:49,333 --> 00:08:51,267
<i>Ricardo and I were supposed
to share this between us</i>

171
00:08:51,633 --> 00:08:53,133
<i> but... I got greedy.</i> [PANTING]

172
00:08:53,267 --> 00:08:55,067
<i>I took all of it.
I ran away from him.</i>

173
00:08:55,433 --> 00:08:59,100
<i>Love, I did it because I want
to give you everything.</i>

174
00:08:59,567 --> 00:09:00,467
<i>- Rudy...
- But now,</i>

175
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:03,433
<i>my sins are coming back
to bite me.</i>

176
00:09:03,767 --> 00:09:05,300
<i>We've been together
all these years</i>

177
00:09:05,433 --> 00:09:06,967
<i> and you've kept this from me?!</i>

178
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:11,367
<i>You lied to me and now even
your son is in danger!</i>

179
00:09:11,900 --> 00:09:12,967
- [SLAP LANDS]
- [YOUNG BELINDA GRUNTS]

180
00:09:13,100 --> 00:09:15,433
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

181
00:09:15,567 --> 00:09:18,300
<i>Mommy, Daddy,
why are you fighting?</i>

182
00:09:18,767 --> 00:09:21,167
<i>- Let's go, son.
- Wait, help me with the gold.</i>

183
00:09:21,567 --> 00:09:23,800
I don't care about any of those!

184
00:09:26,300 --> 00:09:27,367
<i> Let's go.</i>

185
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,833
<i> Rudy!</i>

186
00:09:33,267 --> 00:09:34,333
[YOUNG BELINDA CRYING]

187
00:09:34,467 --> 00:09:36,867
<i> Love, wait! Please wait, love!</i>

188
00:09:38,167 --> 00:09:39,867
<i>Please forgive me for what
I did, love.</i>

189
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,333
[CRYING] I love you two so much.

190
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:47,100
<i> - Daddy...
</i>- [BREATHING HEAVILY]

191
00:09:47,233 --> 00:09:48,333
[GUNSHOT]

192
00:09:48,467 --> 00:09:51,467
[GRIM MUSIC PLAYING]

193
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:53,933
<i> You bastard, Rudy!
</i>[KICKS ON DOOR]

194
00:09:54,067 --> 00:09:55,233
<i> Run! Just run!</i>

195
00:09:55,367 --> 00:09:57,233
- [SCREAMING]
- [GUNSHOTS]

196
00:09:57,367 --> 00:09:58,633
[YOUNG RUDY] Get down!

197
00:10:00,133 --> 00:10:02,033
<i> Come on, hurry!</i>

198
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,467
[YOUNG RUDY] Quick, hide now.

199
00:10:05,467 --> 00:10:07,167
<i> Love, run away now, quick!</i>

200
00:10:07,300 --> 00:10:10,733
[GUNSHOTS]

201
00:10:10,867 --> 00:10:12,833
<i> Mommy...</i>

202
00:10:12,967 --> 00:10:19,567
- [GUNSHOTS CONTINUE]
- [GRIM MUSIC CONTINUES]

203
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,367
[BODY THUDS]

204
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:23,867
<i> Here is the treasure!</i>

205
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:31,833
- [GUNSHOTS]
- [GRIM MUSIC CONTINUES]

206
00:10:39,067 --> 00:10:41,600
[FAINT GUNFIRE IN DISTANCE]

207
00:10:41,733 --> 00:10:43,000
[WHIMPERS]

208
00:10:45,333 --> 00:10:49,333
- [GUNSHOTS]
- [WHIMPERING]

209
00:10:49,467 --> 00:10:51,133
<i> Rudy!</i>

210
00:10:52,167 --> 00:10:54,133
[GUNSHOTS]

211
00:10:54,267 --> 00:10:56,133
[YOUNG BELINDA] Over here!

212
00:10:56,267 --> 00:10:58,667
[SOBBING]

213
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:00,233
[WHIMPERING SOFTLY]

214
00:11:00,367 --> 00:11:01,900
<i> Is this what you want?!</i>

215
00:11:05,067 --> 00:11:06,067
<i> Just take it, then!</i>

216
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:10,000
- [GUNSHOTS]
- [BODY THUDDING]

217
00:11:10,167 --> 00:11:11,567
[SOBS]

218
00:11:11,700 --> 00:11:18,600
[GRIM MUSIC CONTINUES]

219
00:11:45,233 --> 00:11:48,133
<i>Sir, he's gone.
He's dead.</i>

220
00:11:49,367 --> 00:11:54,100
[GOLD BARS CLINKING]

221
00:11:54,233 --> 00:11:56,800
<i>Find out where the rest
of the gold is hidden.</i>

222
00:11:56,933 --> 00:11:58,100
